        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The diagram below shows two different processes for manufacturing black tea. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BbA9d6Dn8oLFByxWDxJl12KTgbg\"><em><strong>The diagram below shows two different processes for manufacturing black tea. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Black Tea Manufacturing Processes</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Black Tea Manufacturing Processes y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về hai quy tr&igrave;nh kh&aacute;c nhau để sản xuất tr&agrave; đen. H&atilde;y t&oacute;m tắt th&ocirc;ng tin bằng c&aacute;ch lựa chọn v&agrave; tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y những đặc điểm ch&iacute;nh, đồng thời đưa ra c&aacute;c so s&aacute;nh khi th&iacute;ch hợp.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Black Tea Manufacturing Processes với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: hai quy tr&igrave;nh kh&aacute;c nhau để sản xuất tr&agrave; đen - so s&aacute;nh phương ph&aacute;p truyền thống sản xuất tr&agrave; l&aacute; v&agrave; kỹ thuật hiện đại tạo ra tr&agrave; t&uacute;i lọc.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về tổng quan c&aacute;c quy tr&igrave;nh v&agrave; c&aacute;c bước ch&iacute;nh:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ClD2dRXIfosgyCxjsUvla657ghl\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>cả hai quy tr&igrave;nh đều c&oacute; c&aacute;c<strong> giai đoạn đầu</strong> <em>(initial) </em>v&agrave; cuối giống hệt nhau, với sự kh&aacute;c biệt chủ yếu xuất hiện ở <strong>c&aacute;c bước xử l&yacute; trung gian </strong><em>(the middle processing steps). </em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZHYxdjA8SoeiNwxWWOKlwfOyglf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trong khi phương ph&aacute;p truyền thống bao gồm<strong> việc v&ograve; l&aacute; </strong><em>(rolling leaves)</em> để <strong>tạo tr&agrave; l&aacute; rời </strong><em>(loose tea),</em> th&igrave; c&aacute;ch hiện đại sử dụng kỹ thuật cắt để tạo ra<strong> c&aacute;c mảnh vụn nhỏ hơn</strong> <em>(smaller granular pieces)</em>, th&iacute;ch hợp cho tr&agrave; t&uacute;i lọc.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c chi tiết dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; về <strong>t&iacute;nh chất sử dụng đất</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DCuZdeWWJohEWlxQOX6l00GFgTc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c bước đầu của hai quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất tr&agrave; đen.</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OU7GdGLLkoYJi8xf3umlDXGwgsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất</strong><em> (manufacturing process)</em> bắt đầu giống hệt nhau đối với cả hai phương ph&aacute;p.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JBcpdie1no2Vvxx5FlnlkfVSg0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>chỉ phần b&uacute;p v&agrave; những l&aacute; tr&ecirc;n c&ugrave;ng được h&aacute;i cẩn thận từ c&acirc;y tr&agrave; <strong>để đảm bảo chất lượng tốt</strong> <em>(to ensure good quality). </em>Những l&aacute; tươi n&agrave;y sau đ&oacute; <strong>được đem đi l&agrave;m h&eacute;o</strong> <em>(undergo withering)</em>, trong đ&oacute; kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute; được thổi qua ch&uacute;ng tr&ecirc;n c&aacute;c gi&aacute; đỡ, loại bỏ 60% <strong>lượng ẩm</strong><em> (moisture content). </em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GabkdnM7lowg97xH378ltXzagWd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&aacute;c quy tr&igrave;nh <strong>bắt đầu kh&aacute;c biệt </strong><em>(diverge)</em> r&otilde; rệt ở giai đoạn tiếp theo. Trong phương ph&aacute;p truyền thống, những l&aacute; đ&atilde; được l&agrave;m h&eacute;o<strong> được v&ograve; dẹt </strong><em>(rolled flat) </em>v&agrave; l&agrave;m g&atilde;y, giải ph&oacute;ng enzyme từ l&aacute;. Ngược lại, phương ph&aacute;p hiện đại bao gồm việc cắt, x&eacute; v&agrave; v&ecirc; tr&ograve;n l&aacute;, tạo ra những mảnh vụn nhỏ <strong>xử l&yacute; nhanh hơn </strong><em>(quick-processing) </em>thay v&igrave; <strong>giữ nguy&ecirc;n cả l&aacute;</strong><em> (whole leaves).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;BODY</span><strong>&nbsp;2:</strong><strong> </strong><strong>C&aacute;c bước c&ograve;n lại của hai quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất tr&agrave; đen.</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XpXjdEmRlosVSSxnKQ5lzDpegNf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>hai phương ph&aacute;p sau đ&oacute; tiếp tục theo <strong>c&aacute;c bước cuối giống nhau</strong><em> (identical final steps).</em> Những l&aacute; đ&atilde; xử l&yacute; được đưa v&agrave;o giai đoạn <strong>oxy h&oacute;a </strong><em>(oxidation)</em> v&agrave; <strong>l&ecirc;n men</strong> <em>(fermentation),</em> trong đ&oacute; ch&uacute;ng được trải ra tr&ecirc;n <strong>nền gạch hoặc nền xi măng</strong><em><strong> </strong></em><em>(tiles or cement surfaces)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NMf2dEH5Fol0wvxXZv3lsjgVghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Giai đoạn n&agrave;y khiến l&aacute;<strong> chuyển sang m&agrave;u đồng</strong><em> (copper color)</em> do enzyme phản ứng với kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute;, đồng thời ph&aacute;t triển hương vị v&agrave; <strong>m&ugrave;i thơm</strong> <em>(aroma). </em>Cuối c&ugrave;ng, l&aacute; được sấy kh&ocirc; cho đến khi loại bỏ 97% <strong>độ ẩm</strong> <em>(moisture),</em> ho&agrave;n tất quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất tr&agrave; đen.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1984,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BI8fdOHQPo6GVgxYpSily4k9gYg\">The diagram illustrates two distinct manufacturing processes used to produce black tea, comparing traditional methods for making loose tea with modern techniques for creating tea bags.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18740,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1985,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overall",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGqjdr21IoXuBoxjzKdlRG3dgEd\">Overall, both processes share identical initial and final stages, with the main differences occurring in the middle processing steps. While the traditional method involves rolling leaves to create loose tea, the modern approach uses cutting techniques to produce smaller granular pieces suitable for tea bags.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18740,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1986,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ty8QdsuNyoz0ahxdF1El5d8egHs\">The manufacturing process begins identically for both methods. First, only the bud and top leaves are carefully picked from tea plants to ensure good quality. These fresh leaves then undergo withering, where air is passed through them on racks, removing 60% of their moisture content.The processes diverge significantly in the next stage. In the traditional method, the withered leaves are rolled flat and broken, releasing enzymes from the leaves. Conversely, the modern method involves cutting, tearing and curling the leaves, which creates quick-processing smaller granular pieces rather than whole leaves.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18740,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1987,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F6Iid9xTnoLn5NxxSsElaIZ9ggb\">Both methods then follow identical final steps. The processed leaves undergo oxidation and fermentation, during which they are spread on tiles or cement surfaces. This stage causes the leaves to change to a copper color as enzymes react with air, developing flavor and aroma. Finally, the leaves are dried until 97% of moisture is removed, completing the black tea manufacturing process.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18740,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
